__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.csv
GATE1_REPORT.md
GATE2_REPORT.md
.env

# cohort config (user ids and timezones) is never committed
cohort.json
COHORT_REPORT.md
FEEDBACK_SIM.md
GATE1_CONTROLS.md
GATE4_SELFTEST.md
GATE4_REPORT.md
GATE3_REPORT.md
