GATE2_SPEC_CURVE.md
.cohort_*
build/
*.pdf
# ...except the published draft, which is generated with --anonymise into paper/.
# The working-identifier build goes to the repository root and stays ignored, so the
# two can never be confused: only a file under paper/ is publishable.
!paper/*.pdf
*.html

# per-user scratch from the external-insulin sensitivity refits
.ext_*

# per-user era-shift and power outputs carry the working identifier in the filename and in the
# text, exactly as the gate reports above do. Only the anonymised ERA_DILUTION_REPORT.md is
# publishable.
ERA_*.md
ERAB_*.md
POWERB_*.md
BASAL_*.md
!ERA_DILUTION_REPORT.md
